摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.3 破甲/清理插件（dsh-purge 分支）：82 条补丁、逐字节可回滚备份、灵魂闸门、31 条单元测试 | DSH jailbreak + patch/uninstall toolkit for 0.2.1-rc.3","id":"gh:1423557296","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"DSH-purge","slug":"dongliuwuzhong-arch/DSH-purge","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","jailbreak","patch-management","rollback"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.3 破甲/清理插件（dsh-purge 分支）：82 条补丁、逐字节可回滚备份、灵魂闸门、31 条单元测试 | DSH jailbreak + pa"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"tch/uninstall toolkit for 0.2.1-rc.3"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-purge"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**DSH 0.2.1-rc.2 / rc.3 / rc.5 / 0.2.2-rc.1 compatibility fork · 1.2.7**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"- Upstream: YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge\n- This fork: dongliuwuzhong-arch/DSH-purge"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 🔴 **Read this first: host patches need a precondition to take effect.**\n>\n> The official desktop b"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"uild seals its host code in `resources\\app.asar`, while patches can only be\n> written into the unpac"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ked `resources\\app\\`. Electron resolves in the order\n> `app.asar` → `app` → `default_app.asar`, so *"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"*as long as the asar exists, the directory is never reached**.\n>\n> \"Patches are applied\" therefore d"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"oes not mean \"patches are in effect\". The only reliable check is\n> whether the status panel still pr"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"ints `✗ app.asar: still present` — that line means everything is idle.\n>\n> Since 1.2.1 the post-upgr"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"ade self-heal is automatic; see `docs/SEALED-ASAR.md`.\n`dsh-purge` is a prompt and host-patch plugin"},{"id":"p5s8","text":" for a local DeepSeek Harness install. It adds a **Clean** dock beside the session title for managin"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"g prompts, rule sets, skills, and host patches. Nothing is written to the host until you explicitly "},{"id":"p5s10","text":", rule sets, skills, and host patches. Nothing is written to the host until you explicitly apply it."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"This repository is a compatibility fork of the upstream project, tracking DSH **0.2.1-rc.2 / rc.3 / "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"rc.5**. It keeps the upstream patch system and injection flow, and maintains the host-version mappin"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"gs, desktop path handling, backup/revert checks, and install notes. It is not a from-scratch replace"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ment, and it does not hide where it came from."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What it actually includes"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Session dock"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The **dsh-purge** button beside the session title opens a right-hand dock. It currently has one page"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"rge** button beside the session title opens a right-hand dock. It currently has one page: **Clean**."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Area | What it does |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Patches | Grouped patch status, Apply, Restore, Uninstall |\n| Prompt | Edit `prompt-inject.md` as "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"the session override |\n| Rule sets | Manage `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` sets; enabling one writes unde"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"r the current `$DSH_HOME` |\n| Skills | Import a zip or folder into this host's official `skills/<id>"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"/SKILL.md`; DSH owns matching and loading |\n| Own servers | Register one IP or exact hostname per li"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"ne in `net-scope-allow.txt` |\n| Rewind | Undo one turn / undo the last round via the official `sessi"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"on.fork({ atSeq })` behavior; also `/rewind` |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Prompt and rules"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- The default inject text ships with the plugin and is embedded at build time. The host's prompt fil"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"e on disk is not read.\n- `prompt-inject.md` is a user file. Revert and uninstall keep it by default."},{"id":"p13s3","text":"\n- Rule sets can be switched; they are written under `$DSH_HOME/rules/`.\n- Workspace policy supports"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" `strict` / `fallback` / `always`, controlling whether DSH's workspace baseline section is kept.\n- S"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"kills stay out of the inject section and do not replace the prompt. Uninstalling the plugin does not"},{"id":"p13s6","text":" delete user-imported skills."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Patches"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- The patch table currently defines **85 patches**. Actual status is matched against the current hos"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"t surface and reported as applied, pending, or skipped.\n- Before the first apply, each target is bac"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ked up as `<file>.dshpurge.bak`; repeated applies are idempotent.\n- **Restore** copies backups back "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"and removes them. If a backup is missing, at least the plugin's shim lines are stripped.\n- **Uninsta"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"ll** restores applied patches first, then removes the inject file, rule library, and the plugin itse"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"lf.\n- If a target already carries patch markers, the plugin refuses to create a fake “identical” bac"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"kup and names the file in status output."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### CLI and chat entry points"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Model tools: `purge_status`, `purge_apply`, `purge_revert`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- Official desktop: DeepSeek Harness **0.2.1-rc.2 / 0.2.1-rc.3 / 0.2.1-rc.5**\n- Official Web: the 0."},{"id":"p21s2","text":"2 line of `dsh web`\n- Node.js **>= 18**; **Node >= 22** is recommended on Windows to avoid console f"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"lashes\n- Web and desktop are installed and applied separately, each with its own profile and `$DSH_H"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"OME`\n- 0.1.x is not supported; use the matching older upstream release for 0.1.7\n- Community Desktop"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"t supported; use the matching older upstream release for 0.1.7\n- Community Desktop is not maintained"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> This package is not on npm. `add dsh-purge` returns 404. Install from the repository archive, a lo"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"cal directory, or a manual copy."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Official desktop"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The ordinary `dsh` CLI refuses `--profile desktop`. Use the desktop CLI shipped inside the install d"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ary `dsh` CLI refuses `--profile desktop`. Use the desktop CLI shipped inside the install directory:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"If the install still has `resources/app.asar`, replace `resources/app/` with `resources/app.asar/` i"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ll has `resources/app.asar`, replace `resources/app/` with `resources/app.asar/` in the paths above."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Official Web"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Offline install (recommended)"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The repository ships an installer that does not run pnpm, does not use the network, and does not app"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ory ships an installer that does not run pnpm, does not use the network, and does not apply patches:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Or install directly from a zip:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The installer validates the package, copies it to `$DSH_HOME/plugins/dsh-purge`, updates the profile"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" `package.json`, links `node_modules/dsh-purge`, and writes `desktop-install.txt`. It does **not** r"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"un pnpm, Apply, or restart DSH."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Manual install"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"1. Find the `$DSH_HOME` the running host actually uses. It must contain `profiles/`, and `profiles/<"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"web|desktop>/package.json` must have `\"name\": \"dsh-profile-web\"` or `\"dsh-profile-desktop\"`.\n2. Put "},{"id":"p37s3","text":"the plugin at `$DSH_HOME/plugins/dsh-purge`. Both the folder name and `package.json` `\"name\"` must b"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"e `dsh-purge`.\n3. Edit only that profile's `package.json`:\n- Add `\"dsh-purge\": \"file:../../plugins/d"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"sh-purge\"` to `dependencies`.\n- Append `\"dsh-purge\"` to `dsh.profile.bundles`.\n4. Create the link (W"},{"id":"p37s6","text":"pendencies`.\n- Append `\"dsh-purge\"` to `dsh.profile.bundles`.\n4. Create the link (Windows Junction):"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
